  "description": "JOYSTAR Brockway Freestyle Kids BMX Bike - 20\" & 24\"\nUnlock your child's inner athlete with the JOYSTAR Brockway Freestyle BMX Bike. Engineered for aspiring youth riders, this bike provides the perfect blend of stability and agility, allowing them to feel confident on all terrain—from the driveway to the dirt track.\n\nDominate the sidewalk with the Brockway’s professional freestyle geometry.\n\nPerformance & Safety Engineering\n\"Built tough for the next generation of stunt riders, the Brockway combines a high-strength frame with precision stopping power for ultimate control.\"\nPrecision Handling & Control\nThe JOYSTAR Brockway is crafted with a durable Hi-Ten steel frame designed to withstand the rigors of freestyle riding. To ensure maximum safety during tricks and high-speed maneuvers, it is equipped with handbrakes (rear linear-pull brakes), providing reliable stopping power across various surfaces.\nKey Features & Benefits\n\nSturdy Build: Features a robust frame that handles jumps and sidewalk cruising with ease.\n\nStunt Pegs Included: Comes with 2 front and rear pegs, enabling riders to master grinds and balance tricks right out of the box.\n\nSuperior Traction: 2.125\" wide pneumatic rubber tires offer extra grip and shock absorption on pavement and dirt.\n\nDurable Drivetrain: Features a single-speed drivetrain with a 1-piece forged steel crank for smooth, consistent power.\n\nQuick & Easy Assembly\nWe know you're eager to ride. The JOYSTAR Brockway arrives 85% pre-assembled. All necessary assembly tools and straightforward instructions are included, typically taking less than 20 minutes to complete the final setup.\n\nStep-by-Step: Get your Brockway from box to park in record time.\n\nSize Chart & Fit Guide\n\nSee It In Action\n\nBuild friendships and memories on every ride.\n\nWatch: Riders pushing their limits with the JOYSTAR Brockway's freestyle capabilities.\n\nTechnical Specifications\n\nPrecision components engineered for durability and performance.\n\nOur Guarantee\nJOYSTAR is committed to quality and rider satisfaction. Our warranty ensures your investment is protected:\n\nLimited Lifetime Warranty: The steel frame is guaranteed against manufacturing defects for as long as the original purchaser owns the bike.\n\nComponent Coverage: Non-wear parts are covered for 2 years against manufacturing defects.",
